& CEOs.\\n\",\"follower_count\":8,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":72100,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"26df9a54ccd4\",\"source_name\":\"Library of Minds\",\"count\":9,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/qbP_8BPC6CJHtz_LOfLgME8YqLBAC4vMGkLPq1Pbg34\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL1YyVUtUcHFhNVUzQllVRkhBTURrZ0Rfb0pBZ1hrdE4tRFhwX1BneFF0RmJGa2hmM0RoNHZhU29iNVc0akk2ZzNQemk0RksydjdIQT1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Delphi is the digital profile of your mind. Most profiles tell the world what you've done. Delphi shows the world what you know.\\n\\nIt's a living identity that others can search, talk to, and learn from - available 24\\/7.\\n\\nOn This Channel: \\nWatch conversations with the world's leading minds. Then talk to them on Delphi.\\n\\nExplore what it is like to make your knowledge infinitely accessible alongside product updates, customer stories, and the greatest digital minds! \\n\\n\ud83d\udd17 https:\\/\\/www.delphi.ai\\/\\n\",\"follower_count\":2,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":6550,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"2c30b8b3f18b\",\"source_name\":\"Core Memory Podcast\",\"count\":31,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/ajaDjHF1dY2shS6GH1l8tAFmPPWkVjWTUppJuxL6xrs\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tLzFSX0RaWmQ4VXVXemZmVDRnWnZHMnFuNHJ5Q3d3UTc2UjdxQkVmeE41STRic1lBamNQajNXQnk1YWhrNV80X3FoeUFIU1BUUHg3cz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"The Core Memory Podcast brings you the people and ideas shaping the future. If you want to be a few years ahead of the rest of the world on science and technology, we are here for you. \\n\\nHosted by journalist, best-selling author and filmmaker Ashlee Vance and tech journo extraordinaire Kylie Robison, the podcast dives into the colorful, ambitious, and occasionally unhinged corners of innovation. These are conversations with the biggest names in tech and the lesser-known geniuses building wild new things. We mix deep reporting with storytelling and humor.\\n\\nVance has spent two decades chronicling the tech industry for The Economist, The New York Times and Bloomberg Businessweek, while writing best-selling books, making Emmy-nominated TV, shows and producing films for HBO and Netflix. Robison has written for Wired, The Verge, Fortune and Business Insider, penning gripping features and breaking countless stories.\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":15000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"ce098ba1b41a\",\"source_name\":\"Latent Space\",\"count\":90,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/fdGXB3Fw5buxC0GzYoV-g2kWVwhrq17mim7sAFdXpxc\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3BTVEhjZmZDWEV2ZXJZRVBkak0waUlSUEgtSVVUNGQyYmlJTVpfWjdiaHlmNnNNRS1sYUZlcjl2RWZwRmJNNXRxRllKVi1Vc0xRPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"The podcast & newsletter where 170,000+ AI Engineers gather to talk models, tools and ideas. Breaking news today you will use at work tomorrow! Full show notes and newsletter at https:\\/\\/latent.space\",\"follower_count\":4,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":166000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"8c029bafbd12\",\"source_name\":\"Citeline Podcasts\",\"count\":101,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/cvKIQuOBiUqCcyYQSbIWb_rJqk9D3cXErirIWZ4hqOk\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9tZWdhcGhvbmUuaW1naXgubmV0L3BvZGNhc3RzL2EwM2NkNGY0LTI2OGItMTFmMS04NzNjLWIzMzg5ZTVkMDI0Ni9pbWFnZS82OTlhNjBhNzU1YmY5NTQ1ODU4NjdjYTNhNzY5YWFiMi5wbmc_aXhsaWI9cmFpbHMtNC4zLjEmbWF4LXc9MzAwMCZtYXgtaD0zMDAwJmZpdD1jcm9wJmF1dG89Zm9ybWF0LGNvbXByZXNz.webp\",\"description\":\"Citeline places biopharma and medical device prof\u2026\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"483657631daf\",\"source_name\":\"The Joe Rogan Experience\",\"count\":117,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/UMm13tjV6aHJEQHDsH8CcIEl9Esw57PI3kLBsnAJB48\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19rSU92OFhTYXlCM21WemRtR0g2cjZuT3VuY2NsY19ReFdyN1RZVFhNNGRGcnM9czA.webp\",\"description\":\"The Joe Rogan Experience podcast\\n\",\"follower_count\":7,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":21100000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"4c16f734d05d\",\"source_name\":\"ColdFusion\",\"count\":19,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/sM3uE8UmS_anm5C9hFi9alAHDHHdM1DqWN8NqZN5s10\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19rSnd2d25DZ1k2OExzSGo0WVNhdXQ4dE9nS19SekZzaXdhT2hOMTNGV3J3Yjg9czA.webp\",\"description\":\"Hi, my name is Dagogo Altraide and I create and narrate all the videos on here.\\nThis channel aims to let you experience the cutting edge of the world around us in a relaxed atmosphere.\\nLearn the captivating stories about how our world came to be and also learn what's happening in the cutting edge today.\\n\\n--- New Thinking Book written by Dagogo Altraide ---\\nLearn the stories of those who invented the things we use everyday. This book is rated the 9th best technology history book of all time by Book Authority!\\nAudio Book: https:\\/\\/goo.gl\\/p8auh3\\nGet the book on Amazon US: http:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/NewThinkingbook\\nAmazon India Link: https:\\/\\/goo.gl\\/qJCC1T\\nAmazon UK link: https:\\/\\/goo.gl\\/RBxisf\\nEbook on Google Play: http:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/NewThinkingGooglePlay\\n\\nMERCH:\\n\\nINTERNATIONAL: https:\\/\\/store.coldfusioncollective.com\\/\\nAUSTRALIA: https:\\/\\/shop.coldfusioncollective.com\\/\\n\\nContact | *Business ONLY* dagogo@coldfusioncollective.com\\n\\nJoin the fun on instagram: \\n\\n@ColdFusiontv\\n\\nFacebook | www.facebook.com\\/coldfusiontv\",\"follower_count\":6,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":5240000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"a1a94cede874\",\"source_name\":\"My First Million\",\"count\":57,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/TvFpOvhrLpzLhNiw4ntcSDmhRjDLRovNKQgrShAoxYI\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0JaVUV0TUJReWhzRGxvYnBRbDRlc29QT0x3ejF1aF9COE01UXN4V29HQWFFcEhrVG5XaHNxSDV0dWtxQlhyVEVvLTUwVVl3QjBBPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"two guys, talking about business. we've done it (sold our companies), and now we talk about new ideas, opportunities, and investments. \\n\\nhosted by Shaan Puri & Sam Parr -- produced by Hubspot. \\n\\nSometimes we bring on guests ranging from billionaires to stay at home moms who've got side hustles that are bringing in $10k a month. \\n\\nwe like to have fun, and talk about business stuff\\n\",\"follower_count\":6,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":954000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"cf35cbd0132d\",\"source_name\":\"Invest Like the Best\",\"count\":42,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/xR2cyn4BqNEZKFmwmvWYxjg79RHSKsSbVjnrG8hShcw\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tLzRCQzBudGxsM3BnNDAxQ1JsOXBpX2NYeFZMYXlZcGw2VkdOamhJUWZIcDlHcFRxbGozcXdHRHRnR19ZQUJwWFRpT2VjOUdBQkJRPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"Conversations with the best investors and business leaders in the world. We explore their ideas, methods, and stories to help you better invest your time and money. Hear stock market and boardroom insights you can't find anywhere else. If you're a professional investor, CEO, entrepreneur, or business strategist, this is for you. Explore all our episodes and learn more at https:\\/\\/www.colossus.com\",\"follower_count\":9,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":103000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"2fe3399ad84a\",\"source_name\":\"Biotech 2050 Podcast\",\"count\":8,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/Q879cHmsCsCDfOveROTpHtKKsJjBPFNGOn7d1fgJY-w\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9pMS5zbmRjZG4uY29tL2F2YXRhcnMtS3ZVeFBXWWR6MndyeklQWi02blFUeFEtb3JpZ2luYWwuanBn.webp\",\"description\":\"Biotech2050 Podcast is a think tank chronicling t\u2026\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"2710eb12b0d5\",\"source_name\":\"Capital Allocators\",\"count\":34,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/IYgbdg8SEIIcaIchGKOQI_OZjp2pHTarutIA0qgtAlg\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2R3cjFNRW1LTFpLbGR3a1N5ZkRYdmtOSVQ3OEMwVnpRUmxLUXB5VV9fRkViNHBKS1F2QXAyUmI3VzFDRHp1Mi13bHUydHJDTjZnPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"Allocator and asset management expert, Ted Seides, conducts in-depth interviews with leaders in the institutional investing industry. Guests include Chief Investment Officers from leading allocators, asset managers, strategists, thought leaders, and many more. Our mission is to learn, share, and help implement the process of premier investors. \\n\\nTed founded Capital Allocators LLC in 2016 to explore best practices in the asset management industry from the perspective of asset owners, managers, and other relevant players. He hosts the Capital Allocators podcast, serves as an advisor to allocators and asset managers, and educates investors.\\n\\nFrom 2002 to 2015, Ted was a founder of Prot\u00e9g\u00e9 Partners LLC and served as President and Co-Chief Investment Officer.\\n\\nTed began his career in 1992 under the tutelage of David Swensen at the Yale University Investments Office. Ted holds a BA, Cum Laude, from Yale University and an MBA from Harvard Business School.\\n\",\"follower_count\":6,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":23100,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"59a5d9375123\",\"source_name\":\"Bankless\",\"count\":96,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/ji3pgjPlwK-_1B15Kv90ITsmzRFInVKXXxDVgSPaSdM\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tLzlEMnNRTm01Yi14WHNER0ltTW9MSWNiOUR0VGM4V2hqRDVSbzlfelR4YWpUOEcya2dRZDVIX0hRcGNXR2VFU2pWRHpRQXRkWXp6bz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Welcome to the Bankless YouTube channel, where we explore the frontier of crypto money and crypto finance. This is how to get started, how to get better, and how to front-run the opportunity.\\n\\nTWITTER:\\n https:\\/\\/x.com\\/Bankless\\n\",\"follower_count\":4,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":280000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"c1f49fceff68\",\"source_name\":\"The Bio Report\",\"count\":28,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/9RdiW7MBVXAIJBPaitzUy_RCmO21AcKV09XI4WiAFpQ\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19rV3d2ckpRYzlwa1FldnQ3MEVRVGFoRkZuNTRFRUd4eFNQUExpVUlzTllBYlk9czA.webp\",\"description\":\"Biotechnology at the intersection of business, science, and policy.\\n\\n\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":180,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"95df011df4c9\",\"source_name\":\"In Good Company with Nicolai Tangen\",\"count\":34,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/pmJF_k_8jSbCfLVgvf17zUjS7TR2vLfSQQmaheZqnzw\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2Q2LVFnMFNCYVZGVVdRWUZjWTFBOTJPZ3lhbVIxbFpkTUNtVVpLZUUtM1o3YjhuTmxDRnVmQ2ZRZkZnNUItUS1Fa3lKeFIwND1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Norges Bank Investment Management manages the Norwegian Government Pension Fund Global, often referred to as the Oljefondet, NBIM or Statens Pensjonsfond Utland (SPU). The aim of the fund is to ensure responsible and long-term management of revenue from Norway\u2019s oil and gas resources so that this wealth benefits both current and future generations of Norway. \\n\\nOur objective as manager of the fund is to generate the highest possible return on the fund. We aim to achieve this in a safe, efficient, responsible and transparent manner, and within government guidelines. \\n\\nWe have offices in Oslo, London, New York and Singapore. Our global presence brings us closer to the markets we invest in and ensures stronger links with partners in different parts of the world. \\n\",\"follower_count\":6,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":130000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"f2591194a029\",\"source_name\":\"BiotechTV - News\",\"count\":64,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/MD50s6_Exk-u0KDBVzMM_9Z0o3ALw_SqvjHG_crLo6o\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9kM3Qzb3pmdG1kbWgzaS5jbG91ZGZyb250Lm5ldC9zdGFnaW5nL3BvZGNhc3RfdXBsb2FkZWRfbm9sb2dvLzQzMDcyMjAyLzQzMDcyMjAyLTE3Mzk4MDI2ODM1NDUtYmVkM2FmYThkZWRhLmpwZw.webp\",\"description\":\"This is the primary news channel of BiotechTV where you will find on the ground reporting by our journalists from biotech hubs throughout the world.\",\"follower_count\":4,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"65aa84568a3d\",\"source_name\":\"SemiAnalysis\",\"count\":17,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/AjYnra3_vju85O4cMPddFyPSjicf0P2M14xfkFt7p94\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l2V0lOOEdNS2E1MFMyOHBXTzRYSFVvdVN2ZjBEX2gyVHM4RDhDUUhZR1pBdzB2Q1Nfbk52XzdLNGpacUoyX1Fwd0NCaF83ZFF3PXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"\",\"follower_count\":5,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":6260,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"a7e7cbab8d81\",\"source_name\":\"Every (AI & I)\",\"count\":55,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/hlqQqNXUqsue3HBjfb_mx0oXHDYfMhe8Jk_PV3oEkI8\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL1I0UF90bnI1RWgtX3lFaEtVRTE0NGgybzdMN19tYVlDdEtHMVkwRGFOZl9xLXpTUVdaU1lDcDJFcmRkOTBPc2hEcDBXU0NMVUZBPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"The only subscription you need to stay at the edge of AI. Ideas, apps, and training:\\nhttps:\\/\\/every.to\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":47600,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"329a6f599aca\",\"source_name\":\"Infectious Disease Puscast\",\"count\":17,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/EGSw7v6BSSzbPUWCzSBcW-_FMd07Lg9z9kJEzydzhDs\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0FPR2FFSk9JWlA5LTdHM1c0OFhPSGdILVo5aGVXOWNBYXJpQThDUVliMXJFT181OHlYYlRRanVocXR6aFROWkNhQW1nU0ljMVZRPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"I'm Vincent Racaniello, Earth's virology Professor and I believe that education should be free. It's my goal to teach virology and other life sciences to the world. Here you'll find my lectures at Columbia University, our science shows This Week in Virology, This Week in Parasitism, This Week in Microbiology, This Week in Evolution, Immune, This Week in Neuroscience, Infectious Disease Puscast, Beyond the Noise, interviews that I've done with microbiologists, livestreams and more. Subscribe and stay tuned for future awesome science content. \\n\\nMicrobeTV is sustained entirely on donations from YOU. If you too believe that education should be free, consider donating to Patreon or PayPal to ensure that this work continues to be distributed to your neighbors and friends.\\n\",\"follower_count\":0,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":144000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"6889e0da6fb5\",\"source_name\":\"Supply Chained\",\"count\":22,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/H32LdQpZSsaSJbVdiqQ1I4f5_ooOWCqgwyywOO77GY8\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9kM3Qzb3pmdG1kbWgzaS5jbG91ZGZyb250Lm5ldC9zdGFnaW5nL3BvZGNhc3RfdXBsb2FkZWRfbm9sb2dvLzQ1ODA5OTAyLzQ1ODA5OTAyLTE3NzY2NDU5MTQwMTktOTQ3NDY4ZWNhMGU5Mi5qcGc.webp\",\"description\":\"Jon of Asianometry and Tim Culpan of Culpium explore the depth &amp; history of supply chains to unveil how today\u2019s technology is made. And what comes next.\",\"follower_count\":7,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"a9f91f59fcc7\",\"source_name\":\"The Circuit\",\"count\":21,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/azoc4ejJzZr4ZrTUnHmM6HFBJRQF0U9HtLHUojcuwd4\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL05Xakd6Y1ptZVFUX09QVFlMYUhkQS1hdUZaRWdkeUVqU05yN2VsZlJuU0U2S0VQbnZ6ZXNNeEdJTGhMNzhZRmdDR2dFUHFJYklxMD1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"A conversation about the business of semiconductors with Jay Goldberg and Ben Bajarin\",\"follower_count\":5,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":28600,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"924c9a8d7b3f\",\"source_name\":\"Goldman Sachs: Exchanges\",\"count\":28,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/EN3DyvMc2xIUwJBPBbgnfv57qfZ_hH7JWVHolFsww0U\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0RQUU9aVi1Gam04OFhDOVhCQTFZd2hCM0xpYVhSZmRyMFp5c0hWbDJQVFAyZlNOU2VzQm02cGs5SHdUVVVDNzNNMDV4N1prSkl1Zz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"The sharpest insights, timely\u00a0analysis, and out-of-consensus thinking from Goldman Sachs.\\n\\nFounded in 1869, our firm delivers world-class execution for clients across our leading Global Banking & Markets and Asset & Wealth Management businesses.\\n\\nWe aspire to be the world\u2019s most exceptional financial institution, united by our shared values of partnership, client service, integrity, and excellence. \\n\",\"follower_count\":6,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":319000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"12674211cdcb\",\"source_name\":\"Biotech Hangout\",\"count\":19,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/KYMh1seebk3ZZrRvqYThVuEga-yxECdwU09BSyGD3Hc\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9kM3Qzb3pmdG1kbWgzaS5jbG91ZGZyb250Lm5ldC9wcm9kdWN0aW9uL3BvZGNhc3RfdXBsb2FkZWRfbm9sb2dvLzE0Mjg1MTUwLzE0Mjg1MTUwLTE2MTc3NDA4NjM4MzItMDY3ZTk4MjM0NzY5Ny5qcGc.webp\",\"description\":\"A weekly discussion of all things biotech \u2013 breaking news, data, deals, and FDA actions \u2013 with a community of biotech industry leaders and experts. Join the live streams hosted by @BiotechCH, @daphnezohar, @bradloncar and @biotech1 on Twitter Spaces every Friday at 12pm ET.\",\"follower_count\":5,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"02f032e82cc5\",\"source_name\":\"Road to Autonomy\",\"count\":78,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/tXcEA4w5gSshcJ6xP42zNGCaFEfIxw_fQTdvFZ-8I2E\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3V3Q0lGVUlYX2xBY3g1b1R5RWl4YmtwYW81SDg1a3VQTk5qMVMwSVh3TUt6Y0pGLS1TdmxZWG1fMFRpWmtCdzFjX1IxaFdXRkZBPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"Conversations with Architects of The Autonomy Economy\\n\\nThe Road to Autonomy is the leading market intelligence platform covering the convergence of automation, autonomy, and the growth of the Autonomy Economy.\\n\\nWe do not chase headlines; Grayson Brulte host the newsmakers. From the founders of startups to the CEOs of publicly traded companies, guests join The Road to Autonomy podcast to articulate their vision, defend their strategies, and signal their next moves.\\n\\nAutonomy Markets breaks down the investment landscape of the autonomy economy. Co-hosted by Grayson Brulte and Walter Piecyk, the show delivers sharp analysis on the publicly traded companies building the future of autonomy.\\n\\nAutonomy Signals is an intelligence briefing show powered by OMEGA, the AI intelligence platform built by AUTNMY AI. Co-hosted by Grayson Brulte and Rob Grant, each episode delivers three signals shaping the autonomy economy.\\n\",\"follower_count\":2,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":3270,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"bd2478ea0413\",\"source_name\":\"In a Nutshell\",\"count\":9,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/r6zynfFv-6vJSU0MUc5cSI1LKwnuOXB94NjgSxa6tko\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19uMVJpYmQ3THdkUF9xS3RxV0wzWkRmSWd2OU0xZDZnNzhWd3BIR1hWUjJJcjQ9czA.webp\",\"description\":\"Animation videos explaining things with optimistic nihilism since 12,013.\\n\\nWe\u2019re a team of illustrators, animators, number crunchers and one dog who aim to spark curiosity about science and the world we live in. To us nothing is boring if you tell a good story.\\n\\nFor updates on our videos and other news from the kurzgesagt universe follow us on Twitter, Facebook, Instagram and LinkedIn.\\n\",\"follower_count\":7,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":25600000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"93b72fa1ec89\",\"source_name\":\"Uncapped with Jack Altman\",\"count\":15,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/JiUoHD_N1_XPqe6na1efXpgrYOf5rruLO9AJ952XlGw\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2xTT2Z6Uk5uTkR2NHFPSWwxamlHR3ladW1XbnpxTnhYaDd5ZW54bmF3YmRWLU43RjB4SlQxMTl5d1p6UFBYSzhhcEVNS1J2c2ZQST1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Conversations with people I admire about things I\u2019m genuinely interested in.\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":28100,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"daf55e50d7cc\",\"source_name\":\"The Hedgineer Podcast\",\"count\":22,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/Mn47WrTvj3NtGPHei1C_81yuSyiuCrqLb9JaW7CPFbg\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0c0b3FUYWZqSUFkZUpwSlFyQVZuLUhTNHZmMVowVm1UWE9paWJ2ZVlRRWlWTWxQeTZvTmowNFc3SUxWWGtxRXk2eEN5ZUxwN2laMD1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"The Hedgineer Podcast covers how AI is reshaping the way hedge funds and asset managers research, operate, and invest. Hosted by Michael Watson (CEO) and Jhanvi Virani (COO) of Hedgineer, we discuss the ways AI is changing how funds run, dive deep into new developments in AI, and host conversations with industry leaders. New episodes drop weekly.\\n\\nHedgineer.io\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":2030,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"ef48c2654f69\",\"source_name\":\"The Knowledge Project\",\"count\":24,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/MqoC_fIfqZZ_JkoZTvDnyPzm795NWDnCLh_aLptHIrY\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2Q4RU4tRGFfdUNPNHQ0Q2ZTeUN5cTJxWTJmdEZkYzM4dGNCaERiWW1iME9IbWUzVlBwT05CVnJEdEtJb3RaV0pXZlFUTV9GTz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Uncovering the timeless principles that drive success.\\n\",\"follower_count\":2,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":441000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"de34f76beb9c\",\"source_name\":\"Training Data\",\"count\":29,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/pvV75druuoD4D01lBOJPtq-IIeberPvsjwTNgh1yHv8\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9tZWdhcGhvbmUuaW1naXgubmV0L3BvZGNhc3RzLzhjYThhNjFjLTA4YjQtMTFlZi05N2FiLTlmZTI3M2Q1OTAzMC9pbWFnZS80YTE2ZmQzM2IwNjcwODAwMzgyNzU1NjIwOWNkNDJiNy5wbmc_aXhsaWI9cmFpbHMtNC4zLjEmbWF4LXc9MzAwMCZtYXgtaD0zMDAwJmZpdD1jcm9wJmF1dG89Zm9ybWF0LGNvbXByZXNz.webp\",\"description\":\"Join us as we train our neural nets on the theme of the century: AI. Sonya Huang, Pat Grady and more Sequoia Capital partners host conversations with leading AI builders and researchers to ask critical questions and develop a deeper understanding of the evolving technologies\u2014and their implications for technology, business and society.\\n\\n\ufeffThe content of this podcast does not constitute investment advice, an offer to provide investment advisory services, or an offer to sell or solicitation of an offer to buy an interest in any investment fund.\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"1a3dde5624b6\",\"source_name\":\"BioCentury This Week\",\"count\":35,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/TvWs59SMIvK13pVOeAyqOkkNs6T8leHGmM2fFdSmWZs\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0tHWnNoUHBHM0V2QVl2b0tGU3I1NnpsQTNjenVxZWNoU2JDWHZGUG96ZmpKSkY3Q2dpalI3bml1VUVxRFI3WE5lNllnSEhkT1pnPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"For three decades, BioCentury has helped biopharma executives and investors make business-critical decisions. No matter where you are in the drug development process, BioCentury empowers you to answer critical questions; decipher strategic trends; evaluate product and business strategies; and assess competitive, financial, and policy risks. For a free trial to the BioCentury platform, please visit: BioCentury.com. \",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":1400,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"c2c3e3fcee7e\",\"source_name\":\"Founders\",\"count\":26,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/6FK-1aLORs632JGzPBT0FG_nR7hNaIDp56S3yeGu2Lo\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19sbkRKdlRCeVMyYzNod1pScW80RmQ3TzZpSGpxRVpYT0xrajVoNVNCVDRyUmM9czA.webp\",\"description\":\"Learn from history's greatest entrepreneurs. Every week I read a biography of an entrepreneur and find ideas you can use in your work. \\n\\nThis quote explains why: \\n\\n\u201cThere are thousands of years of history in which lots and lots of very smart people worked very hard and ran all types of experiments on how to create new businesses and invent new technology. They ran these experiments throughout their entire lives. At some point, somebody put these ideas down in a book. For very little money and a few hours of time, you can learn from someone\u2019s accumulated experience. There is so much more to learn from the past than we often realize. You could productively spend your time reading experiences of great people who have come before and you learn every time.\u201d \u2013Marc Andreessen\",\"follower_count\":7,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":293000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"1cf863b47408\",\"source_name\":\"The Top Line\",\"count\":42,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/UngnnB1JJF1pZpz8xBpChS6gh6yGDA2sHUqHhejJUw8\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cub21ueWNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2QvcHJvZ3JhbXMvYzVmYjlmY2YtZDE3My00ZTA3LTkxYTMtYWU4NTAwZWNlZjhmLzdkYjNkY2M2LTA5NjgtNGI5ZC05YzA2LWFlODUwMTE1OTc4Yi9pbWFnZS5qcGc_dD0xNjUxMTY5MDA5JnNpemU9TGFyZ2U.webp\",\"description\":\"<p>Biopharma and medtech explained. Every week, journalists from Fierce Biotech, Fierce Medtech, and Fierce Pharma recount the latest industry trends and why they matter. We'll analyze the week's biggest business news, from mergers and marketing to drug R&amp;D and device development. Available every Friday morning.&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"47fb40d8d15e\",\"source_name\":\"Business Of Biotech\",\"count\":27,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/deV4THmsK-jO6Ho93G-MUdJ7A1Ilf1SOF2dT7vd_9t4\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19rY25WZmxzZEtfSXZKTkFDX2tQdTN0cnVPUWlFSXlwMUVudEoxeVFQZllEUT1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Life Science Connect\u2019s vision is to facilitate connections and foster collaborations in pharmaceutical, biotech, and medical device industries. We facilitate engagement across the drug development life cycle through our web portals, publications, events, and training.\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":3860,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"a2018e6d0594\",\"source_name\":\"Acquired\",\"count\":6,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/4Ae0ezscEek2o0rjxxKSS69HX71ofkYhVlCq7FlWHmU\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3MwZG45QTJyb0V5WUJKS2YyZkMwUkx5a21qRGRELWNxVi1ILWh0TDhmVmdCek1lZ0kwUUozcUp6cjNoRG9UYnlrX0JKOTNYVz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Every company has a story. Learn the playbooks that built the world\u2019s greatest companies \u2014 and how you can apply them. \\n\\nThis channel contains just the podcast episodes with video. For ALL the episodes, search \\\"Acquired\\\" in your favorite podcast player or go to https:\\/\\/www.acquired.fm\\/\\n\",\"follower_count\":8,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":330000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"5109fc9dc6e9\",\"source_name\":\"Starter Story\",\"count\":48,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/sQgaWV1LajLUvApa3igDMLGy4DTgMreSSxY80eQ52Ic\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0ZiWFhoUDV5Q2VxbndHeXE2WDEwZGNTN0ktX0MyQkhzbE5ScExTSVJaNVJxenZOZEc5WDdsOHpuSFE3ZktjWHhmR2tqcHpETWxnPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"Sharing ideas that make money!\",\"follower_count\":7,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":876000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"c731756e9ae3\",\"source_name\":\"Jordi Visser\",\"count\":30,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/JM_UT1x0QIY0uK2-5Szr6nIPVkOFUYRwK3qHsEBqZnI\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0tFUVR1WU9iUW5ZcVZ2SGkwN1Fuc1RjZVVqSlVYV05wZTNtWGMzZlZmeXFpVWhGdzNYQ3hIZTVldUF4bG5zQmVad0oxVmRRUkdBPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"\\nEmpowering seasoned professionals to navigate the future of finance, technology, and AI.\\n\\nWhat We Offer:\\n- \ud83d\udcca Cutting-edge market analysis and economic insights\\n- \ud83d\udd2e Forecasts on impending market regime shifts\\n- \ud83d\udca1 Strategic investment approaches for dynamic markets\\n- \ud83d\udd11 Crypto essentials for experienced TradFi professionals\\n- \ud83c\udf09 Bridging traditional finance (TradFi) to decentralized finance (DeFi)\\n- \ud83e\udd16 Practical guidance on integrating AI into personal and professional life\\n\\nWith over 30 years of expertise in traditional finance, I guide you through the evolving landscape of investments, from conventional assets to cryptocurrencies and AI-driven technologies.\\n\\n\ud83d\udcf1 Follow on Twitter: @jvisserlabs\\n\ud83c\udf10 Stay Updated with My Latest Written Insights!  - substack.com\\/@visserlabs\\n\\n\\nDisclaimer: This channel offers educational content only. Always consult with qualified financial and technology advisors before making investment or implementation decisions.\",\"follower_count\":9,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":69800,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"a01c807a762a\",\"source_name\":\"The Intrinsic Value Podcast\",\"count\":32,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/WCUig19MoMvKGUqQoh_Q_fBpsAbJfZZxTYD8FWXe0-4\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9tZWdhcGhvbmUuaW1naXgubmV0L3BvZGNhc3RzLzA3NjA3MWVlLTc1OWItMTFlZS1hNzkxLWQ3MGY4Yzk1ZTY4MS9pbWFnZS83ZDQwNGY0ZDFiY2Y2MzhmZDQ4MmY4Yzg0ZGJhMDhjYy5wbmc_aXhsaWI9cmFpbHMtNC4zLjEmbWF4LXc9MzAwMCZtYXgtaD0zMDAwJmZpdD1jcm9wJmF1dG89Zm9ybWF0LGNvbXByZXNz.webp\",\"description\":\"Presented by The Investors Podcast Network with over 10 million downloads \u2014 home to the popular We Study Billionaires podcast, The Intrinsic Value Podcast is a new show focused on breaking down businesses, estimating their intrinsic value per share, and deciding whether they should be added to an ongoing portfolio of stocks built out each week. From assessing the monopoly power of Google to determining the fair value of publicly-traded sports franchises, no topics is off limits in the pursuit of understanding as many different businesses as possible and putting together the ultimate long-term stock portfolio.\\n\\nEvery week, The Intrinsic Value Podcast will you help get smarter about business, valuation, and investing \u2014 don\u2019t miss out on the journey!\\nSupport our show by becoming a premium member! https:\\/\\/theinvestorspodcastnetwork.supportingcast.fm\",\"follower_count\":2,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"eea4c981f7f2\",\"source_name\":\"This Week in Virology\",\"count\":76,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/EGSw7v6BSSzbPUWCzSBcW-_FMd07Lg9z9kJEzydzhDs\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0FPR2FFSk9JWlA5LTdHM1c0OFhPSGdILVo5aGVXOWNBYXJpQThDUVliMXJFT181OHlYYlRRanVocXR6aFROWkNhQW1nU0ljMVZRPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"I'm Vincent Racaniello, Earth's virology Professor and I believe that education should be free. It's my goal to teach virology and other life sciences to the world. Here you'll find my lectures at Columbia University, our science shows This Week in Virology, This Week in Parasitism, This Week in Microbiology, This Week in Evolution, Immune, This Week in Neuroscience, Infectious Disease Puscast, Beyond the Noise, interviews that I've done with microbiologists, livestreams and more. Subscribe and stay tuned for future awesome science content. \\n\\nMicrobeTV is sustained entirely on donations from YOU. If you too believe that education should be free, consider donating to Patreon or PayPal to ensure that this work continues to be distributed to your neighbors and friends.\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":144000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"7ec96f5b3b89\",\"source_name\":\"Investor's Sunday\",\"count\":37,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/4rnAJfbQow6rjF7hcZ5ItKHbvMS2L4UqT9siTbsu-xA\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9tZWdhcGhvbmUuaW1naXgubmV0L3BvZGNhc3RzLzg4NWQzNzBhLTQ2NDMtMTFlZS1iYmVhLTBmYmFhODlhMDVmMy9pbWFnZS80OTE2MjY4Nzc3YzE5Y2I0YTgxZTAxNDhlOGY2ODAwYi5qcGc_aXhsaWI9cmFpbHMtNC4zLjEmbWF4LXc9MzAwMCZtYXgtaD0zMDAwJmZpdD1jcm9wJmF1dG89Zm9ybWF0LGNvbXByZXNz.webp\",\"description\":\"\u201c\u3086\u3063\u305f\u308a\u3068\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u66dc\u65e5\u306e\u671d\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3082\u5965\u6df1\u3044\u6295\u8cc7\u3084\u7d4c\u55b6\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u306e\u305e\u3044\u3066\u307f\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\uff1f\u201d\\n\\n\u666e\u6bb5\u3042\u307e\u308a\u8868\u306b\u51fa\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306e\u5c11\u306a\u3044\u7b2c\u4e00\u7dda\u3067\u6d3b\u8e8d\u3059\u308b\u6295\u8cc7\u5bb6\u3084\u7d4c\u55b6\u8005\u3092\u30b2\u30b9\u30c8\u306b\u304a\u547c\u3073\u3057\u3066\u3001\u6295\u8cc7\u306b\u307e\u3064\u308f\u308b\u5c02\u9580\u7684\u306a\u5185\u5bb9\u304b\u3089\u4f1a\u793e\u7d4c\u55b6\u306b\u304a\u3051\u308b\u30ce\u30a6\u30cf\u30a6\u3001\u65e5\u672c\u5e02\u5834\u306e\u8ab2\u984c\u3001\u6ce8\u76ee\u306e\u7d4c\u6e08\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30b9\u307e\u3067\u6df1\u5800\u308a\uff01\\n\u4ed6\u3067\u306f\u805e\u3051\u306a\u3044\u5207\u308c\u5473\u92ed\u3044\u7d4c\u6e08\u30c8\u30fc\u30af\u3092\u304a\u9001\u308a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\\n\\n\u6295\u8cc7\u5bb6\uff08\u30a2\u30af\u30c6\u30a3\u30d3\u30b9\u30c8\uff09\u306f\u3001\u6295\u8cc7\u5148\u306e\u4f01\u696d\u3068\u201c\u5bfe\u8a71\u201c\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u3088\u308a\u4f01\u696d\u4fa1\u5024\uff08\u682a\u4fa1\uff09\u3092\u9ad8\u3081\u308b\u201d\u30a8\u30f3\u30b2\u30fc\u30b8\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u201c\u3092\u884c\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\\n\u305d\u306e\u4f01\u696d\u306e\u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9\u3084\u30ce\u30a6\u30cf\u30a6\u3001\u96c7\u7528\u306a\u3069\u69d8\u3005\u306a\u3082\u306e\u3092\u5b88\u308a\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3001\u540c\u6642\u306b\u65e5\u672c\u5e02\u5834\u3082\u6d3b\u6027\u5316\u3059\u308b\u3001\u305d\u3093\u306a\u610f\u7fa9\u6df1\u304f\u30c0\u30a4\u30ca\u30df\u30c3\u30af\u306a\u6295\u8cc7\u5bb6\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u3054\u7d39\u4ecb\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\\n\\n\u4eca\u306e\u6642\u4ee3\u3092\u751f\u304d\u629c\u304f\u7d4c\u55b6\u306e\u30d2\u30f3\u30c8\u3082\u6e80\u8f09\u3067\u3059\u3002\\n\u3053\u306e\u756a\u7d44\u3092\u8074\u3051\u3070\u3001\u660e\u65e5\u304b\u3089\u4e16\u754c\u306e\u898b\u3048\u65b9\u304c\u5c11\u3057\u5909\u308f\u308b\u304b\u3082\u77e5\u308c\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\\n\\n\uff0a\u3053\u306e\u756a\u7d44\u3067\u306f\u4f01\u696d\u3084\u682a\u4e3b\u306b\u95a2\u3059\u308b\u60c5\u5831\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u3066\u304a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u6295\u8cc7\u305d\u306e\u4ed6\u306e\u884c\u52d5\u3092\u52e7\u8a98\u3059\u308b\u3082\u306e\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"c4a0a3cfa5a1\",\"source_name\":\"The Economist\",\"count\":29,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/m4EVaOTD-l4hif0rRdG3Ccv1yxPlHUhpWlQKpoDm8cE\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3BCdzNHT0tsVFlCYXJJRTBxRTUtY05vSUhNTmJQR3NFUjYxa3VKQzVNU0k2SHpxVjE2ZmNhUVpRbFVTeGxKTVVGaTBfLVM5VkF3PXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"The Economist gives authoritative insight and opinion on everything from international news to politics, business, finance, science and technology. Our YouTube channel transforms our rigorous reporting and independent thinking into visual intelligence. With in-depth analysis and a global perspective, The Economist\u2019s videos explain today\u2019s most important news and events, and seek to discern the trends that will shape tomorrow.\\n\\n\\nSubscribe to The Economist's YouTube channel to be the first to see our latest videos.\\n\",\"follower_count\":7,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":4160000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"4562f7bdfb92\",\"source_name\":\"CLS\u540c\u5b78\",\"count\":36,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/xEzFcslCMXccbMFYO1jbtlKUhd1DhHqWW5mHrkFXrTA\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9pMi5oZHNsYi5jb20vYmZzL2ZhY2UvYzVlOWNiYWY3NDkzNzRiNWUwNmQyMmU0MTg4N2YwNjBkZTg5NTk1Zi5qcGc.webp\",\"description\":\"\u672c\u7855\u53cc9\uff0c\u5b8f\u89c2\\/\u4ea7\u4e1a\u7ecf\u6d4e\u7814\u7a76\u8005\uff0c\u6838\u5fc3\u7cfb\u5217\u6bcf\u6708\u3010\u5b8f\u89c2\u63a8\u6f14\u3011\uff0c\u516c\u4f17\u53f7\u540c\u540d\",\"follower_count\":4,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":1127753}},{\"source_id\":\"7705a1847b3b\",\"source_name\":\"Goldman Sachs: The Markets\",\"count\":18,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/EN3DyvMc2xIUwJBPBbgnfv57qfZ_hH7JWVHolFsww0U\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0RQUU9aVi1Gam04OFhDOVhCQTFZd2hCM0xpYVhSZmRyMFp5c0hWbDJQVFAyZlNOU2VzQm02cGs5SHdUVVVDNzNNMDV4N1prSkl1Zz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"The sharpest insights, timely\u00a0analysis, and out-of-consensus thinking from Goldman Sachs.\\n\\nFounded in 1869, our firm delivers world-class execution for clients across our leading Global Banking & Markets and Asset & Wealth Management businesses.\\n\\nWe aspire to be the world\u2019s most exceptional financial institution, united by our shared values of partnership, client service, integrity, and excellence. \\n\",\"follower_count\":4,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":319000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"4b24c343992f\",\"source_name\":\"Medicine and Science from The BMJ\",\"count\":10,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":null,\"description\":null,\"follower_count\":0,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"85552f49b37f\",\"source_name\":\"The Plain Bagel\",\"count\":12,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/U5vgzTJIFJMDc_7gBLgYbZX6mD0zNx6J01q9bxjVXu8\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19sUDQ0YURlQnZ6U2hYMGdQVlJzTDlVWVk3X1ZsR2YwQ0cwSTlQRGFIaWIwVnc9czA.webp\",\"description\":\"Investing and personal finance educational videos with a hint of economics, posted regularly.\\n\\nI'm a CFA charterholder and CFP professional working as an analyst for an investment management company in Ottawa. I'm a huge finance nerd and am passionate about the field - I think people lack the resources they need to make educated financial decisions, and hopefully this channel helps with that!\\n\\nFor collaboration\\/other inquiries: richard@theplainbagel.com\\n\\nFor sponsorships:\\nsponsorships@theplainbagel.com\\n\\nDISCLAIMER:\\nThe videos on this channel are for education purposes only and do not constitute financial advice. Richard Coffin does not provide recommendations on The Plain Bagel - those looking for investment advice should seek out a registered professional. Richard is not responsible for investment actions taken by viewers and his content should not be used as a basis for investment trades.\",\"follower_count\":2,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":1210000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"faa38c29e6e1\",\"source_name\":\"DNA Today\",\"count\":26,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/0-3ZfJ-XIH-9bZsC0NofKRcSf_X06dY5kmx_2AYhvbw\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3JSbnpsb2U1QzFVQjc1YWItcFpQNUhCMDZxVHl1ZGtxaEJBbGdCU3hyLUVJR1dycUhMc1JjNVRzck45Wk5VUWtyUjdoRklWb1ZRPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"\\\"DNA Today\\\" is a genetics podcast in the top 1% of podcasts globally and winner of the Best 2020 and 2021 Science and Medicine Podcast Awards. Over the last decade, the show has produced over 200 episodes covering topics like genetic conditions, technology, careers, and news. Host Kira Dineen interviews leaders in genetics including genetic counselors, researchers, doctors and patient advocates.\\n\\nKourtney Kardashian featured our host Kira Dineen and the podcast in her recent article on Poosh. With over 40 sponsors, including leaders like Illumina and ThermoFisher, \\\"DNA Today\\\" is valued as a leading voice in genetics.    \\n\\n\\\"DNA Today\\\" is broadcast every Friday 10:30am EST on WHUS 91.7 FM in Connecticut.\",\"follower_count\":4,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":3830,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"1b487155fdee\",\"source_name\":\"Beyond Biotech\",\"count\":28,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/adw4V1-BVbXC5AY7ZcS08PDOB3ticwD1qhD-hNKR26I\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19tS1BJMzVwX2FOY21MaTh2dmp4Z0VSYkEwMmNReHFHYVlNSVNMbjlhWHFxWnc9czA.webp\",\"description\":\"Labiotech.eu is an online publication covering the global biotech industry, with a mix of news and in-depth analysis. Updated daily, the site also includes a weekly podcast.\",\"follower_count\":4,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":4520,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"dadd8b32fdd8\",\"source_name\":\"No Priors\",\"count\":40,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/2DEPrKMQLheucjbviokV1zGUahQmNEzI-pMV0VJ6x-A\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0hRWElwa0xtc19pVk1pX09iNUNpZTNQTmNaM3NtT1Q3SGVOTElBV3ZCTy1sWk1kaWF4Mk41TEgxYmxXTXhVdE1ySkNjWHlOWj1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Your guide to the AI revolution, co-hosts Elad Gil and Sarah Guo talk to the world's leading engineers, researchers and founders about the biggest questions:\\n\\nHow far away is AGI? What markets are at risk for disruption? How will commerce, culture, and society change? What\u2019s happening in state-of-the-art in research? Email feedback to show@no-priors.com.\\n\\nSarah Guo is a startup investor and the founder of Conviction, an investment firm purpose-built to serve intelligent software, or \\\"Software 3.0\\\" companies. She spent nearly a decade incubating and investing at venture firm Greylock Partners.\\n\\nElad Gil is a serial entrepreneur and a startup investor. He was co-founder of Color Health, Mixer Labs (which was acquired by Twitter). He has invested in over 40 companies now worth $1B or more each, and is also author of the High Growth Handbook.\\n\",\"follower_count\":5,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":96200,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"4a1d36698bd9\",\"source_name\":\"\u7845\u8c37101\",\"count\":38,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/XiTbiRUN8tmz7Yxq18RL3gEGUrkGvrg-N1q_q_Zc19o\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tLzhLSmZuUkllMmFiaThvMXA3enBfbUdnUlQ1VVgzUHRjUkhYX1dLUUFLTEZQWDI1bl9uZWpyYlIyd2dxR1VpbGNSVEg4SUtQbW53PXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"\u300a\u7845\u8c37101\u300b\u662f\u4e00\u6863\u5206\u4eab\u5f53\u4e0b\u6700\u65b0\u9c9c\u7684\u6280\u672f\u3001\u77e5\u8bc6\u4e0e\u601d\u60f3\u7684\u79d1\u6280\u64ad\u5ba2\uff0c\u6211\u4eec\u8fd8\u62e5\u6709\u4e00\u6863\u540c\u540d\u89c6\u9891\u8282\u76ee\u300a\u7845\u8c37101\u300b\u3002\\n\u5176\u4ed6\u8ba2\u9605\u6e20\u9053\uff1aApple podcast\uff5cSpotify\uff5c\u5c0f\u5b87\u5b99\\n\u8054\u7cfb\u6211\u4eec\uff1apodcast@sv101.net\\n\",\"follower_count\":10,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":77700,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"7e0d92c0b9fb\",\"source_name\":\"The Long Run with Luke Timmerman\",\"count\":15,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/zebkxZhfcayXTdJ73PLlOMYqlaBBExDn2RlasKn87eA\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2tqY0NsbjdPNW1ZWFJGV0ZoMHI3RkZYMVJ0SDZfZjRYU05TRkxzaUpjemVESHFMNUh0bnpFMF9tU24tNnRkVTZER1B5OW5abz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"\\\"The Long Run\\\"\\n\\nAntarctic explorer Ernest Shackleton would appreciate today's biotech. Scientific entrepreneurs of the 21st century must be ready for what Shackleton called the \u201chazardous journey, bitter cold, long months of complete darkness, constant danger, safe return doubtful, honor and recognition in case of success.\u201d Today, the men and women who strive to apply science for the betterment of human health have a historic opportunity. They need stamina and resilience to achieve something meaningful. Biotech\u2019s relationship with the society that sustains it has never been more tenuous.\\n\\nJoin host Luke Timmerman for in-depth, thought-provoking conversations with biotech newsmakers pursuing these great opportunities of the 21st century.\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":218,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"289a177bf726\",\"source_name\":\"\u5c0fLin\u8bf4\",\"count\":14,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/gpqLnGdHTagvtgf8WtyNbpi5ki-NDbbbdGQCEIrE9xY\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2RET3VDeXprVkJ3R2FwSm90M21BR3FxMV8yX3NuZzdwZ25QdGtHRjF1U21jbGVPNHA2TzRPeDZmbEZ6d0Y3dllEaXVOdjJJX21BPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"Hi~ \u6211\u662fLindsay\uff0c\u6b22\u8fce\u6765\u5230\u6211\u7684\u9891\u9053\uff01\u5e0c\u671b\u80fd\u8ddf\u5927\u5bb6\u4e00\u8d77\u4e50\u4e50\u5475\u5475\u6da8\u70b9\u77e5\u8bc6~~\\n\u7b80\u5355\u4ecb\u7ecd\u4e00\u4e0b\u6211\u81ea\u5df1\uff1a\u5317\u5927\u672c\u79d1 - \u54e5\u5927\u7814\u7a76\u751f - JP Morgan- \u521b\u4e1a\\nB\u7ad9\u3001\u6296\u97f3\u3001\u89c6\u9891\u53f7\u3001\u77e5\u4e4e\u3001\u5c0f\u7ea2\u4e66\u3001\u5934\u6761\u540c\u540d\u201c\u5c0fLin\u8bf4\u201d\\n\\n!!\u6ca1\u6709Facebook\uff0c\u6ca1\u6709Telegram\uff0c\u6ca1\u6709Whatsapp\uff0c\u6ca1\u6709\u7c89\u4e1d\u7fa4\uff0c\u8fd9\u4e9b\u5e73\u53f0\u6240\u6709\u8d26\u53f7\u90fd\u662f\u9a97\u5b50!!\\n\u4e0d\u4f1a\u4ee5\u4efb\u4f55\u65b9\u5f0f\u4e3b\u52a8\u8981\u6c42\u79c1\u4fe1\uff0c\u8bf7\u5927\u5bb6\u8c28\u9632\u53d7\u9a97!!\\n\\n\u5546\u52a1\u5408\u4f5c: xiao_lin_shuo@163.com\\n\\n================\u52a0\u5165\u6211\u4eec================\\n\u5c0fLin\u56e2\u961f\u5e0c\u671b\u80fd\u627e\u5230\u559c\u7231\u6211\u4eec\u9891\u9053\u7684\u6709\u8bc6\u4e4b\u58eb\u3002\u5982\u679c\u5bf9\u5185\u5bb9\u3001\u89c6\u9891\u5236\u4f5c\u3001\u8fd0\u8425\u611f\u5174\u8da3\u7684\u5c0f\u4f19\u4f34\u6b22\u8fce\u628a\u7b80\u5386\u548c\u81ea\u6211\u4ecb\u7ecd\u53d1\u9001\u5230\uff1axiaolin_recruiting@163.com\\n\\n\",\"follower_count\":8,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":2820000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"0a1d035724d8\",\"source_name\":\"Lenny's Podcast\",\"count\":50,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/itg8RHVDJBeFyvwVGCLfcVNaqxbVWgj2JqPLEF6F33g\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL1drNy00VVcxN0pxRFhnVldEaUU3czFnSnhEa3RfVXdOYTJvTnc4T1lSd2M5ZGVpQ3YyVjJmRkFkTmdCeURpMEs5QUFGMFlNaj1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Interviews with world-class product leaders and growth experts to uncover concrete, actionable, and tactical advice to help you build, launch, and grow your own product.\",\"follower_count\":5,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":636000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"292d0a867a33\",\"source_name\":\"BioVenture VoiCes\",\"count\":12,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/_mL_58VBAdlZ332HSpqJQP9g7C1cjycuesAeBft5-d0\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly9kM3Qzb3pmdG1kbWgzaS5jbG91ZGZyb250Lm5ldC9zdGFnaW5nL3BvZGNhc3RfdXBsb2FkZWRfbm9sb2dvLzQzMDcwNzA2LzQzMDcwNzA2LTE3Mzk3OTQ5NTU5ODQtNWRmYmU5NjU2ZGI5Yi5qcGc.webp\",\"description\":\"Hosted by Chris Garabedian, meet the leading Voices in the BioVenture community and hear their insights and perspectives on the challenges and successes with VC investing.\",\"follower_count\":2,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"0da8ef6bed3a\",\"source_name\":\"\u75af\u6295\u5708\",\"count\":23,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/drOEOmmE5Co1s2a8qcewXZs-_-gobCh5g9XS3c43K38\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL285c0Z4SERzeEdLZXc5eVFEVTQ4cnFnNjVScWVOWlRQZlJsSXFZNE9KcFZ1b1ozUGpGXzhGanUyQnB6TWVsZEFwY2x2enBWRT1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":367,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"8e40320d994a\",\"source_name\":\"Vanguards of Health Care by Bloomberg Intelligence\",\"count\":28,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/PXYrmNT5Tx-F9Gc_-2jk43ik9ABrtfqELZ8AdDgQ_7I\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cub21ueWNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2QvcHJvZ3JhbXMvZTczYzk5OGUtNmU2MC00MzJmLTg2MTAtYWUyMTAxNDBjNWIxL2U4NGI1NjY0LWNiMjMtNGRiOS04MmQ1LWFmYzUwMGYyMzNiNi9pbWFnZS5qcGc_dD0xNjc4ODA1MDMxJnNpemU9TGFyZ2U.webp\",\"description\":\"<p>Vanguards of Health Care is a series of exclusive conversations with management teams and thought leaders discussing changes on the forefront of the industry, including innovations in medical products and technologies, advances in clinical research, new service models, wellness and regulations.<\\/p>\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"803e53c8000d\",\"source_name\":\"\u5f20\u5c0f\u73faJ\u00f9n\uff5c\u5546\u4e1a\u8bbf\u8c08\u5f55\",\"count\":31,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/amMLDRpXzzUzcTz3O_PpBwIq4SP2KmIHeufNlXRRohc\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3UwMDEtQ18tXzN1a2h3ZFZxUXR2MWh6elktVUxGNW5VLV9PNWxXM3V3NHY2M25tRUcxU1hZTThZS1QxWlpWeWxQV3czaTRWeFVRPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"Together with you, we explore a new world!\\n\\nZhang Xiaojun Podcast is an in-depth talk show featuring long-form conversations of 2 to 7 hours. It centers on authentic personal expression and high-density cutting-edge information. Produced by Language Is World Studio.\\n\\nHost Zhang Xiaojun is a financial journalist specializing in in-depth coverage of tech industry, including AI, tech giants, venture capital, and prominent figures. She has won 13 journalism awards at home and abroad, among which she received the SOPA (Society of Publishers in Asia) Award for Excellence in Journalism for three consecutive years from 2022 to 2024 \u2014 widely known as the \\\"Pulitzer Prize of Asia.\\\" She is also the founder of Language Is World Studio.\\n\\n\\\"If my interviews can walk with you along a lonely and unknown path, and bring you a little closer to your destination one day, my heart will be filled with warmth.\\\" \u2014 Zhang Xiaojun\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":42400,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"d98898bd96e2\",\"source_name\":\"\u7f85\u6c38\u6d69\u7684\u5341\u5b57\u8def\u53e3\",\"count\":23,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/VTjwmnzsd3ZQ9QNm3upUUfpAmXdagx3KokdYBaNgk4E\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tLzdILUpxSm1wUmVyc0haLVVuR1pyYkxxXzZMcE5wT3Z4d1hPSWxfRkVkeE9oLWxrdmlER2hFVlZpeXp3S2MtRG5XR1NIVVpfNz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"This is a long-form podcast hosted by Luo Yonghao, with each episode spanning three to five hours.\\n\\nWhere technology is married with the liberal arts, we engage in deep conversations with the defining figures of our time \u2014 exploring human destiny, creative ambition, and the forces shaping the future. Through stories of individual lives, we reflect on the broader transformations of an evolving era.\",\"follower_count\":0,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":44600,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"7011b13d102d\",\"source_name\":\"Talking Biotech\",\"count\":17,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/-2t4yufD-loFJ9i5B84HD8skSWXEIhMawPgzjMfWpMc\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\.webp\",\"description\":\"Talking Biotech is a weekly podcast that uncovers the stories, ideas and research of people at the frontier of biology and engineering.\",\"follower_count\":4,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"8af742bcd061\",\"source_name\":\"Trumponomics\",\"count\":21,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/iUKGjlWy-PWv3ILSkeCkiGJmPSl8bIKvUBqoUBHghpI\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL1BYVFVSclZIUElrZzhWbWIzQXZwaGNJQmNTS0UzM2txRE9neWVVdlZMRnNEQWtFR2FtWHBhRWhFWWg5WU5FUmt2clcxQkJtQz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Bloomberg Podcasts brings you the best video and audio programming from Bloomberg. Watch for news and analysis on the stories making headlines in business, technology and financial markets.\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":573000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"88f58c0908ee\",\"source_name\":\"Behind the Balance Sheet\",\"count\":5,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/Kg2kopv8zFaf7eG-sdfEm3UcUAO37zZx72U4tBDYrjQ\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19raDFqYjE1d0V1UElTRDRfZ0xnb2xRSVd1VGN6S3dVdHJtaUU0c0JaTGo9czA.webp\",\"description\":\"Behind the Balance Sheet helps professional and serious private investors read between the lines of financial statements and value businesses properly. Hosted by ex\u2011Tiger Cub hedge fund partner Stephen Clapham, the channel features in\u2011depth interviews with top investors and forensic breakdowns of accounting red flags, capex, and valuation.\\n\\n\ud83d\udce9 Free weekly forensic investing email: https:\\/\\/behindthebalancesheet.substack.com\\/\\n\\n\ud83c\udf93 Learn more about our online Analyst Academy course: https:\\/\\/behindthebalancesheet.com\\/product\\/analyst-academy\\/\\n\\n\ud83c\udfa7 Podcast: https:\\/\\/behindthebalancesheet.com\\/podcasts\\/\\n\\n\ud83c\udf93 Learn more about our institutional Forensic Accounting courses: https:\\/\\/behindthebalancesheet.com\\/forensic-course\\/\\n\\nCopyright \u00a9 Behind the Balance Sheet Ltd, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026\\nDisclaimer: https:\\/\\/www.behindthebalancesheet.com\\/disclaimer-terms-conditions \\n\",\"follower_count\":2,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":13000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"a11abdd39e02\",\"source_name\":\"Gradient Dissent\",\"count\":8,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/nwYdK9TQsPIkYOaZVdrfEwv2dvVvelNvklJ9W7ZiLPg\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19saWJfYTRMRk5FN1hNbkxIR0pxa2hLbk4ySF9TdTZvRkFiZTVEZHI4UGVvZz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Weights & Biases helps AI developers build better models faster. Quickly track experiments, version and iterate on datasets, evaluate model performance, reproduce models, and manage your ML workflows end-to-end.\\n\\nPlease subscribe to our channel and turn on notifications for future videos!\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":70000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"b0302217358d\",\"source_name\":\"This Week in Neuroscience\",\"count\":6,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/EGSw7v6BSSzbPUWCzSBcW-_FMd07Lg9z9kJEzydzhDs\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0FPR2FFSk9JWlA5LTdHM1c0OFhPSGdILVo5aGVXOWNBYXJpQThDUVliMXJFT181OHlYYlRRanVocXR6aFROWkNhQW1nU0ljMVZRPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"I'm Vincent Racaniello, Earth's virology Professor and I believe that education should be free. It's my goal to teach virology and other life sciences to the world. Here you'll find my lectures at Columbia University, our science shows This Week in Virology, This Week in Parasitism, This Week in Microbiology, This Week in Evolution, Immune, This Week in Neuroscience, Infectious Disease Puscast, Beyond the Noise, interviews that I've done with microbiologists, livestreams and more. Subscribe and stay tuned for future awesome science content. \\n\\nMicrobeTV is sustained entirely on donations from YOU. If you too believe that education should be free, consider donating to Patreon or PayPal to ensure that this work continues to be distributed to your neighbors and friends.\\n\",\"follower_count\":1,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":144000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"7b4365f26f13\",\"source_name\":\"Long Strange Trip: CEO to CEO with Brian Halligan\",\"count\":3,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":null,\"description\":null,\"follower_count\":1,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":null,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"65aa84568a3d\",\"source_name\":\"SemiAnalysis Weekly\",\"count\":11,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/AjYnra3_vju85O4cMPddFyPSjicf0P2M14xfkFt7p94\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l2V0lOOEdNS2E1MFMyOHBXTzRYSFVvdVN2ZjBEX2gyVHM4RDhDUUhZR1pBdzB2Q1Nfbk52XzdLNGpacUoyX1Fwd0NCaF83ZFF3PXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"\",\"follower_count\":5,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":6260,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"4452cbaa558e\",\"source_name\":\"Beyond the Noise\",\"count\":21,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/EGSw7v6BSSzbPUWCzSBcW-_FMd07Lg9z9kJEzydzhDs\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0FPR2FFSk9JWlA5LTdHM1c0OFhPSGdILVo5aGVXOWNBYXJpQThDUVliMXJFT181OHlYYlRRanVocXR6aFROWkNhQW1nU0ljMVZRPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"I'm Vincent Racaniello, Earth's virology Professor and I believe that education should be free. It's my goal to teach virology and other life sciences to the world. Here you'll find my lectures at Columbia University, our science shows This Week in Virology, This Week in Parasitism, This Week in Microbiology, This Week in Evolution, Immune, This Week in Neuroscience, Infectious Disease Puscast, Beyond the Noise, interviews that I've done with microbiologists, livestreams and more. Subscribe and stay tuned for future awesome science content. \\n\\nMicrobeTV is sustained entirely on donations from YOU. If you too believe that education should be free, consider donating to Patreon or PayPal to ensure that this work continues to be distributed to your neighbors and friends.\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":144000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"6f18728bae38\",\"source_name\":\"This Week in Microbiology\",\"count\":2,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/EGSw7v6BSSzbPUWCzSBcW-_FMd07Lg9z9kJEzydzhDs\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0FPR2FFSk9JWlA5LTdHM1c0OFhPSGdILVo5aGVXOWNBYXJpQThDUVliMXJFT181OHlYYlRRanVocXR6aFROWkNhQW1nU0ljMVZRPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"I'm Vincent Racaniello, Earth's virology Professor and I believe that education should be free. It's my goal to teach virology and other life sciences to the world. Here you'll find my lectures at Columbia University, our science shows This Week in Virology, This Week in Parasitism, This Week in Microbiology, This Week in Evolution, Immune, This Week in Neuroscience, Infectious Disease Puscast, Beyond the Noise, interviews that I've done with microbiologists, livestreams and more. Subscribe and stay tuned for future awesome science content. \\n\\nMicrobeTV is sustained entirely on donations from YOU. If you too believe that education should be free, consider donating to Patreon or PayPal to ensure that this work continues to be distributed to your neighbors and friends.\\n\",\"follower_count\":1,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":144000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"a694c3515faa\",\"source_name\":\"BG2Pod\",\"count\":2,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/cgXbisZCZjWII2pnp-sTulVshGr5TAJysqmevPBZXKo\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2JTOVkzb3FXWXIyaGFtZWd4UVRwU0VLaVN4d0tkVmRadDB1NmQySmJvWXFhd3M3bVRwRHNOeEg2Qy1DSGpVS0VpaEFYemdOQUhnPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"Open Source bi-weekly convo w @altcap & @bgurley on all things tech, markets, investing & capitalism\\n\",\"follower_count\":5,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":103000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"33ddb4011d0c\",\"source_name\":\"Goldman Sachs: Talks at GS\",\"count\":7,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/EN3DyvMc2xIUwJBPBbgnfv57qfZ_hH7JWVHolFsww0U\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL0RQUU9aVi1Gam04OFhDOVhCQTFZd2hCM0xpYVhSZmRyMFp5c0hWbDJQVFAyZlNOU2VzQm02cGs5SHdUVVVDNzNNMDV4N1prSkl1Zz1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"The sharpest insights, timely\u00a0analysis, and out-of-consensus thinking from Goldman Sachs.\\n\\nFounded in 1869, our firm delivers world-class execution for clients across our leading Global Banking & Markets and Asset & Wealth Management businesses.\\n\\nWe aspire to be the world\u2019s most exceptional financial institution, united by our shared values of partnership, client service, integrity, and excellence. \\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":319000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"0e87d065108d\",\"source_name\":\"WhynotTV Podcast\",\"count\":2,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/X4hymmP0AfWtLvCYOhPh9jyz1lcDhBvXWlLR179y518\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tLzl0aXYyVXV2NVphaVNSdl84OHZ2ZnVqSXdwZVRkUVRBMEw2eXF3Mi1PcEM5M2N5REZHeDdMeHRGYS0xOHloeF9UQTAtVmdwQlZnPXMw.webp\",\"description\":\"tairanhe.com Robotics&AI PhD Student @CMU_Robotics:\\n1- WhynotTV Podcast\u662f\u4e00\u6863\u6df1\u5ea6\u3001\u4e13\u4e1a\u3001\u786c\u6838\u3001\u8d85\u957f\u65f6\u957f\uff082\u5c0f\u65f6-4\u5c0f\u65f6\uff09\u7684AI\u79d1\u6280\u89c6\u9891\u64ad\u5ba2\\n2- WhynotTV Vlog\\/Talk \u751f\u6d3b\u7ecf\u9a8c\u5206\u4eab \\n\",\"follower_count\":1,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":24500,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"3fd239769036\",\"source_name\":\"Stripe Sessions\",\"count\":13,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/JZALjAzkeAb2iCCTotVrWJRUbh0jjAFIejtRC1vmjlU\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2tVYV95ZGstY1lLclZhM0YyWGJyczU0cXptSVhsNlpDdVNnckpSNmxJTVdqLVZxWkx0eWNON000RHZ4eWVld1BZM2xkRjN2TD1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Building programmable financial services. Advancing ideas for progress.\",\"follower_count\":5,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":111000,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"f9be3a456081\",\"source_name\":\"The Memo by Howard Marks\",\"count\":2,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/8dNWKnuKAXpfZFo1RlU6UJ8-Fb3gt3mB0MMdGe0hZ58\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3l0Yy9BSWRyb19rTnA2VExJWGdBek1zNWl1SHRQUjVhVEx2aWtLWDRLdFpGZWp1RzlaUHRsRlE9czA.webp\",\"description\":\"Welcome to Oaktree\u2019s official YouTube Channel. Oaktree is a leader among global investment managers specializing in alternative investments. The firm emphasizes an opportunistic, value-oriented, and risk-controlled approach to investments in credit, equity, and real estate. For additional information, please visit Oaktree\u2019s website at http:\\/\\/www.oaktreecapital.com\\/.\\n\\nSubscribe for videos related to our investment philosophy, strategies, careers, community and more.  \\n\\nFor important disclosures, please visit http:\\/\\/www.oaktreecapital.com\\/socialmedia.\",\"follower_count\":9,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":79100,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}},{\"source_id\":\"5fe644590389\",\"source_name\":\"M\u4ebf\u8d22\u5bccMEmoney\",\"count\":6,\"is_followed\":false,\"followed_at\":null,\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.biggo.com\\/F4OggC5pgxbCAiDnB5itcy5BDU9pvPMUVs6_vzFuQzE\\/fit\\/160\\/0\\/sm\\/0\\/aHR0cHM6Ly95dDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL3NvZTVnNUtiUWVMejJWVG96Y01OeWo5Q1Q4Nzh0QUt5ZVJ0aUJicFd6MVdpdEpTeVBoSEY2VTVuNVFuT3Y1Z0lTM0N3OVVEYXFJST1zMA.webp\",\"description\":\"Hello \u5927\u5bb6\u597d\uff0c\u6211\u662fM~\\n\\nM\u4ebf\u8d22\u5bcc\u2764\ufe0f~\u90fd\u662f\u56f4\u7ed5\u7740\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u4ea7\u4e1a\u7684\u539f\u521b\u6545\u4e8b\u3002\u6d3b\u5728\u79d1\u6280\u4e3b\u5bfc\u65f6\u4ee3\u7684\u6211\u4eec\uff0c\u90fd\u5e94\u8be5\u5173\u5fc3\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u7684\u53d1\u5c55\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u4e0d\u7ba1\u662f\u4eba\u5de5\u667a\u80fd\u8fd8\u662f\u91cf\u5b50\u8ba1\u7b97\uff0c\u90fd\u79bb\u4e0d\u5f00\u82af\u7247\u3002\\n\\n\u6211\u4e0d\u4f1a\u8fc7\u5206\u5439\u6367\uff0c\u4e5f\u4e0d\u4f1a\u523b\u610f\u8d2c\u4f4e\uff0c\u7ed9\u5927\u5bb6\u5e26\u6765\u6700\u4e2d\u80af\u7684\u4e13\u9898\u6545\u4e8b\uff01\\n\\n\u6bcf\u5468\u4e09\uff0c\u4e0b\u53485\u70b9\uff01\u66f4\u65b0\u54e6~\u2765(^_-)\\n\",\"follower_count\":3,\"platform_subscribers\":{\"youtube\":48400,\"rss\":null,\"bilibili\":null}}]}}"}, "headersSize": -1, "bodySize": -1, "redirectURL": ""}, "cache": {}, "timings": {"send": -1, "wait": -1, "receive": 0.593}, "_resourceType": "fetch"}, {"startedDateTime": "2026-09-18T06:01:44.181Z", "time": 0.373, "request": {"method": "GET", "url": "https://api.biggo.com/api/v1/finance/podcast/hot/key-entities?size=8&region=tw", "httpVersion": "HTTP/2.0", "cookies": [], "headers": [{"name": ":authority", "value": "api.biggo.com"}, {"name": ":method", "value": "GET"}, {"name": ":path", "value": "/api/v1/finance/p